<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
  <!-- Chart.js -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.3.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/d3@7"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container mt-4">
    <header class="mb-5">
      <h1 class="text-center">Text Embedding Models</h1>
      <p class="lead text-center">From Basics to Advanced</p>
    </header>

    <div class="row mb-5">
      <div class="col-md-12">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h2>What are Embeddings?</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p>Embeddings are dense vector representations of words or phrases that capture semantic relationships. They allow us to represent text in a way that machines can understand and process.</p>
            <p>This application demonstrates various text embedding techniques, progressing from simple to more complex models.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <!-- Navigation tabs -->
      <div class="col-md-12">
        <ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="embeddingTabs" role="tablist">
          <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
            <button class="nav-link active" id="one-hot-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#one-hot" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="one-hot" aria-selected="true">One-Hot Encoding</button>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
            <button class="nav-link" id="bow-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#bow" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="bow" aria-selected="false">Bag of Words</button>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
            <button class="nav-link" id="tfidf-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tfidf" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="tfidf" aria-selected="false">TF-IDF</button>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
            <button class="nav-link" id="word-embeddings-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#word-embeddings" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="word-embeddings" aria-selected="false">Word Embeddings</button>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
            <button class="nav-link" id="compare-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#compare" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="compare" aria-selected="false">Compare Methods</button>
          </li>
        </ul>
        
        <!-- Tab content -->
        <div class="tab-content" id="embeddingTabsContent">
          <!-- One-Hot Encoding Tab -->
          <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="one-hot" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="one-hot-tab">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card-header">
                <h3>One-Hot Encoding</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <p>The simplest form of word embedding. Each word is represented as a binary vector where only one element is 1 (hot) and the rest are 0.</p>
                
                <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="form-group mb-3">
                      <label for="oneHotText">Enter a sentence:</label>
                      <textarea id="oneHotText" class="form-control" rows="3">cat sits on mat</textarea>
                    </div>
                    <button id="oneHotAnalyzeBtn" class="btn btn-primary">Analyze</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="alert alert-info">
                      <h5>Advantages:</h5>
                      <ul>
                        <li>Simple to implement</li>
                        <li>No assumptions about word relationships</li>
                      </ul>
                      <h5>Disadvantages:</h5>
                      <ul>
                        <li>Dimensionality increases with vocabulary size</li>
                        <li>No notion of word similarity</li>
                        <li>Sparse representation</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
                <div id="oneHotResults" class="mt-4 results-section" style="display:none;">
                  <h4>Results</h4>
                  <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                      <div id="oneHotStats" class="mb-3"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                      <div class="visualization-container">
                        <canvas id="oneHotChart" width="400" height="300"></canvas>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <table id="oneHotTable" class="table table-bordered table-striped mt-3">
                    <thead>
                      <tr>
                        <th>Word</th>
                        <!-- Dynamic columns for dimensions -->
                      </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                      <!-- Dynamically populated -->
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Bag of Words Tab -->
          <div class="tab-pane fade" id="bow" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="bow-tab">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card-header">
                <h3>Bag of Words (Count Vectorization)</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <p>Bag of Words (BoW) is a method that counts the frequency of each word in a document, discarding grammar and word order.</p>
                
                <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="form-group mb-3">
                      <label for="bowText">Enter sentences (one per line):</label>
                      <textarea id="bowText" class="form-control" rows="5">The cat sits on the mat
The dog sits on the floor
The cat and dog play together</textarea>
                    </div>
                    <button id="bowAnalyzeBtn" class="btn btn-primary">Analyze</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="alert alert-info">
                      <h5>Advantages:</h5>
                      <ul>
                        <li>Simple to understand and implement</li>
                        <li>Captures word frequency information</li>
                      </ul>
                      <h5>Disadvantages:</h5>
                      <ul>
                        <li>Ignores word order and context</li>
                        <li>Sparse representation</li>
                        <li>High dimensionality</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
                <div id="bowResults" class="mt-4 results-section" style="display:none;">
                  <h4>Results</h4>
                  <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                      <div id="bowStats" class="mb-3"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                      <div class="visualization-container">
                        <canvas id="bowChart" width="400" height="300"></canvas>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="mt-3">Bag of Words Matrix</h5>
                  <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table id="bowTable" class="table table-bordered table-striped">
                      <thead>
                        <tr>
                          <th>Document</th>
                          <!-- Dynamic columns for words -->
                        </tr>
                      </thead>
                      <tbody>
                        <!-- Dynamically populated -->
                      </tbody>
                    </table>
                  </div>
                  
                  <h5 class="mt-4">Document Similarity Matrix</h5>
                  <div class="visualization-container mt-2">
                    <canvas id="bowSimilarityChart" width="400" height="300"></canvas>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- TF-IDF Tab -->
          <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tfidf" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tfidf-tab">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card-header">
                <h3>TF-IDF (Term Frequency-Inverse Document Frequency)</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <p>TF-IDF extends the bag of words model by weighting terms based on how important they are to a document in a collection.</p>
                
                <div class="alert alert-secondary mb-3">
                  <h5>TF-IDF Formula:</h5>
                  <p><strong>TF-IDF = TF × IDF</strong></p>
                  <p><strong>TF (Term Frequency):</strong> How frequently a term appears in a document.<br>
                     TF(t, d) = (Number of times term t appears in document d) / (Total number of terms in document d)</p>
                  <p><strong>IDF (Inverse Document Frequency):</strong> How rare a term is across all documents.<br>
                     IDF(t) = log(Total number of documents / Number of documents containing term t)</p>
                  <p>Higher TF-IDF values indicate terms that are both frequent in a specific document and rare across the corpus, making them more important for document distinction.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="form-group mb-3">
                      <label for="tfidfText">Enter sentences (one per line):</label>
                      <textarea id="tfidfText" class="form-control" rows="5">The cat sits on the mat
The dog sits on the floor
The cat and dog play together</textarea>
                    </div>
                    <button id="tfidfAnalyzeBtn" class="btn btn-primary">Analyze</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="alert alert-info">
                      <h5>Advantages:</h5>
                      <ul>
                        <li>Captures word importance in context of the document collection</li>
                        <li>Reduces the impact of common words</li>
                      </ul>
                      <h5>Disadvantages:</h5>
                      <ul>
                        <li>Still ignores word order and semantic meaning</li>
                        <li>Sparse representation</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
                <div id="tfidfResults" class="mt-4 results-section" style="display:none;">
                  <h4>Results</h4>
                  <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-12">
                      <div class="visualization-container">
                        <canvas id="tfidfChart" width="400" height="300"></canvas>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="mt-3">TF-IDF Matrix</h5>
                  <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table id="tfidfTable" class="table table-bordered table-striped">
                      <thead>
                        <tr>
                          <th>Document</th>
                          <!-- Dynamic columns for words -->
                        </tr>
                      </thead>
                      <tbody>
                        <!-- Dynamically populated -->
                      </tbody>
                    </table>
                  </div>
                  
                  <h5 class="mt-4">Document Similarity Matrix</h5>
                  <div class="visualization-container mt-2">
                    <canvas id="tfidfSimilarityChart" width="400" height="300"></canvas>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Word Embeddings Tab -->
          <div class="tab-pane fade" id="word-embeddings" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="word-embeddings-tab">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card-header">
                <h3>Word Embeddings</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <p>Word embeddings represent words as continuous vector spaces where semantically similar words are closer to each other.</p>
                
                <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="form-group mb-3">
                      <label for="embeddingText">Enter sentences (one per line):</label>
                      <textarea id="embeddingText" class="form-control" rows="5">The cat sits on the mat
The dog sits on the floor
The cat and dog play together</textarea>
                    </div>
                    <button id="embeddingAnalyzeBtn" class="btn btn-primary">Analyze</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="alert alert-info">
                      <h5>Advantages:</h5>
                      <ul>
                        <li>Captures semantic relationships between words</li>
                        <li>Lower dimensionality than one-hot encoding</li>
                        <li>Enables meaningful vector operations</li>
                      </ul>
                      <h5>Disadvantages:</h5>
                      <ul>
                        <li>Requires large training corpus</li>
                        <li>Fixed vocabulary</li>
                        <li>Context-independent (same vector for all uses of a word)</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
                <div id="embeddingResults" class="mt-4 results-section" style="display:none;">
                  <h4>Results</h4>
                  <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-12">
                      <div id="embeddingVisualization" class="visualization-container" style="height: 400px;"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  
                  <h5 class="mt-4">Sentence Embeddings</h5>
                  <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table id="embeddingTable" class="table table-bordered table-striped">
                      <thead>
                        <tr>
                          <th>Sentence</th>
                          <th>Dimension 1</th>
                          <th>Dimension 2</th>
                        </tr>
                      </thead>
                      <tbody>
                        <!-- Dynamically populated -->
                      </tbody>
                    </table>
                  </div>
                  
                  <h5 class="mt-4">Sentence Similarity Matrix</h5>
                  <div class="visualization-container mt-2">
                    <canvas id="embeddingSimilarityChart" width="400" height="300"></canvas>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Compare Methods Tab -->
          <div class="tab-pane fade" id="compare" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="compare-tab">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card-header">
                <h3>Compare Embedding Methods</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <p>Compare different embedding techniques to see which ones work best for different types of text.</p>
                
                <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="form-group mb-3">
                      <label for="sentence1">Sentence 1:</label>
                      <input type="text" id="sentence1" class="form-control" value="The cat sits on the mat">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group mb-3">
                      <label for="sentence2">Sentence 2:</label>
                      <input type="text" id="sentence2" class="form-control" value="A dog is sitting on the floor">
                    </div>
                    <button id="compareBtn" class="btn btn-primary">Compare</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="alert alert-info">
                      <h5>What This Shows:</h5>
                      <p>This comparison demonstrates how different embedding methods calculate similarity between sentences:</p>
                      <ul>
                        <li><strong>One-Hot/Bag of Words:</strong> Based on exact word overlap</li>
                        <li><strong>TF-IDF:</strong> Weighs words by their importance in the corpus</li>
                        <li><strong>Word Embeddings:</strong> Captures semantic relationships between words</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
                <div id="compareResults" class="mt-4 results-section" style="display:none;">
                  <h4>Results</h4>
                  <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                      <div id="compareStats" class="mb-3"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                      <div class="visualization-container">
                        <canvas id="compareChart" width="400" height="300"></canvas>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  
                  <div id="compareAnalysis" class="mt-4"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <footer class="mt-5 text-center text-muted">
      <hr>
      <p>Text Embedding Models Demo &copy; 2025</p>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha1/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>